{
  "name": "@johnmorrisdotca/toranpu",
  "version": "1.2.0",
  "description": "Playing cards and a card game engine for JavaScript and TypeScript: a 52-card deck with a seeded shuffle, and the full rules of Hearts, Spades, Euchre, Cribbage, Oh Hell, Crazy Eights, Go Fish, Big Two, President and Gin Rummy, each with a computer player. Saved games, a command line, English and Japanese. Zero dependencies.",
